From a46d59c74befe29517617851f8ca2ac460b90ea0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:09:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RN1 pilot meter: completed pairs are realized cash at pairing

The venue nets a YES+NO pair when the second leg fills and pays its $1 at
once (first pilot: venue cash 321.3138 -> 321.6638, no resolution row).
The meter no longer waits for a settlement event that never comes.

- realized_net_usd: completed-pair cash - fees + settled residual results
- outstanding contracts/cost, residual worst case, fees, rebates reported
  separately; unrealized pair edge is zero by construction
- netting is checked, not assumed: an unresolved market whose venue
  position is not |YES - NO| is position_unconfirmed and fails closed
- campaign loss stop latches on realized net; at-risk total is unchanged
- venue account cash logged with PILOT_PNL against a stored baseline
  (report only: shared account)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HTk927uH8zwpj6gLES92PF
